### =====================================================
### WD-5779: Signup password policy - POST /Account/signup/password-policy
### Anónimo con la llave del registro (SelfSignup:ApiKeys). La política de
### sistema, que es la que valida signup.
### =====================================================

### Llave del registro (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/password-policy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}"
}

### Llave que no está en SelfSignup:ApiKeys → 401 API_KEY_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/password-policy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiKey": "no-existe"
}
